|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Akshan''' can activate ''Heroic Swing'' three times before the ability goes on cooldown, and can use the third cast only after {{fd|0.5}} seconds of the second cast. '''Akshan''' may input an attack or movement command to use the second and third casts.
|description2 = {{sbc|First Cast:}} '''Akshan''' fires a hook in the target direction that embeds in the first [[terrain]] hit, and enters {{tt|preparation|See notes}} for up to {{fd|2.125}} seconds. ''Heroic Swing's'' second cast can be used while the hook is attached. If the hook fails to attach or '''Akshan''' is {{tt|moved|See notes}} or becomes {{tip|immobilize|immobilized}}, {{tip|ground|grounded}}, or {{tip|polymorph|polymorphed}} within the duration, the preparation will end prematurely, cancelling ''Heroic Swing'' in the process.
|icon3        = Heroic Swing 2.png
|description3 = {{sbc|Second Cast:}} '''Akshan''' {{tip|dash|swings}} around the terrain in either a clockwise or counterclockwise direction based on the position of the cursor relative to his {{tt|facing direction|See notes}}, stopping upon colliding with an enemy champion or terrain. While swinging, he fires at the nearest {{tip|sight|visible}} enemy every {{rutngt|0.2}} to deal them {{as|physical damage}} and apply {{tip|on-hit}} effects for each shot, with on-hit damage reduced to 25% effectiveness.<br><br>'''''Akshan''' will be {{tip|knockdown|knocked down}} by any {{tip|immobilize|immobilizing}} or {{tip|polymorph|polymorphing}} crowd control during the dash.''
|leveling3    = {{st|Physical Damage per Shot|{{ap|8 to 40}} {{as|(+ 25% AD)}} {{times}} {{as|(1 + {{fd|0.3}} per 100% '''bonus''' attack speed)}}}}
|description4 = {{sbc|Third Cast:}} '''Akshan''' ends the swing by {{tip|dash|jumping}} to the target location, though not through terrain, and fires one last shot at a nearby {{tip|sight|visible}} enemy.
|description5 = Scoring an enemy champion {{tip|takedown}} reduces ''Heroic Swing's'' {{sti|'''current''' cooldown}} to {{fd|0.5}} seconds. The shots can {{tip|critically strike}} for{{ft|{{as|{{critical damage|150|50}}|critical damage}} damage|{{sti|{{as|50% '''bonus''' critical damage}}}}}}and {{tip|applies life steal|apply}} {{as|{{sti|life steal}}}}.
|description6 = ''{{ai|Avengerang|Akshan}} and {{ai|Going Rogue|Akshan}} can be cast during the third cast's dash. {{ai|Comeuppance|Akshan}} can be cast at all points during Heroic Swing, though '''Akshan''' cannot fire during the swing while it is active. '''Akshan''' prioritizes firing at enemy champions with stacks of {{ai|Dirty Fighting|Akshan}}, then those damaged by his {{tip|unit-targeted|targeted}} spells in the last 4 seconds, then the nearest enemy. Heroic Swing can be cast during '''Akshan's''' other abilities.''
